# Silvercoat Lion (2/2) attacks; Hill Giant (3/3) blocks. The Lion deals 2 to
# the Giant (survives, 3 toughness); the Giant deals 3 to the Lion (dies, 2
# toughness) -- CR 510.1b, no decision needed on either side.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 2=1
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
# One more advance for the state-based-action check that actually moves the
# lethally-damaged Lion to the graveyard (destroyDamagedCreatures runs on
# phase entry, not inside DealCombatDamage itself).
advance
